    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_649_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_053",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_649_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_053",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Well?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lt. Colonel Lettou"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_649_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_053",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Inventory check. This lot of factories has handed in its designated amount of material.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Mercenary"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_649_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_053",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Excellent.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lt. Colonel Lettou"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0.2
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.3
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_649_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ms. Catherine, as you know, taking on Londinium's hundreds of factories and ensuring their smooth operation is by no means a simple feat.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lt. Colonel Lettou"
    },
    {
        "text": "Thus, my only option is to personally see every handover completed.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lt. Colonel Lettou"
    },
    {
        "text": "Some unpleasantness always comes part and parcel, but this handover, out of this final set of factories, has been the smoothest.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lt. Colonel Lettou"
    },
    {
        "text": "I must thank you for your willing cooperation, and for sparing me so much time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lt. Colonel Lettou"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_648_1#1$1",
        "fadetime": 0.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I just don't want to do anything that'd be of no avail.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Catherine"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_649_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I admire your attitude, Ms. Catherine.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lt. Colonel Lettou"
    },
    {
        "text": "But I'm afraid your heart of hearts doesn't agree with you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lt. Colonel Lettou"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_648_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You mean...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Catherine"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_649_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I hear a few days ago, some workers fled your factory. Being the case, I'd like to take stock of personnel while I'm here, and have a look at your factory's names.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lt. Colonel Lettou"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_648_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Catherine"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_648_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...It was my grandson who ran.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Catherine"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_659_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Catherine...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Londinium Worker"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_649_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lt. Colonel Lettou"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_648_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Young 'uns tend to do without thinking.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Catherine"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_649_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Very plain-dealing of you, Ms. Catherine, but frankness alone will not quell this matter.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lt. Colonel Lettou"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_648_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sir, I can't guarantee you everyone under me is of one mind. I don't have that capacity.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Catherine"
    },
    {
        "text": "I can only guarantee this factory hands in its designated material quota.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Catherine"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_649_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lt. Colonel Lettou"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_649_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Could I ascertain\u2014are you asking me to let him go?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lt. Colonel Lettou"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_648_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "He's a single tyke, every hair on his head out of place. He's hardly going to affect this factory's operation.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Catherine"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_649_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "But you could.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lt. Colonel Lettou"
    },
    {
        "text": "I've heard about your past deeds, Ms. Catherine.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lt. Colonel Lettou"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_649_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "No wonder you were chosen as a workers' representative. A woman of honor. I esteem you for it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lt. Colonel Lettou"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_649_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "But we always must nip these things at the bud. Or are you able to guarantee me that your grandson won't become a traitor to us, such as... if he joined that Self-Salvation Corps that's all the vogue.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lt. Colonel Lettou"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_648_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I've no need to guarantee it, Sir.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Catherine"
    },
    {
        "text": "Young 'uns always think they can do something.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Catherine"
    },
    {
        "text": "But it always turns out they don't know what it is they're facing.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Catherine"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_648_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "They'll... nip themselves.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Catherine"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_649_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...I understand your sentiment.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lt. Colonel Lettou"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_649_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lt. Colonel Lettou"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_649_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Indeed. Pursuing a single escaped worker pales in comparison to the gravity of ensuring a dozen factories continue to stably operate.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lt. Colonel Lettou"
    },
    {
        "text": "I can overlook this affair, Ms. Catherine.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lt. Colonel Lettou"
    },
    {
        "text": "But I do hope you're able to keep your promise.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lt. Colonel Lettou"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_648_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "As long as I'm in charge of this factory, there'll never be a problem.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Catherine"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_649_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Excellent. In that case, it's time we get on with the handover ceremony.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lt. Colonel Lettou"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
