    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_053",
        "name2": "avg_npc_054",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "*sigh* Just our goddamned luck. I wanted to go to the factory too and watch the flag raising.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Mercenary A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_053",
        "name2": "avg_npc_054",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Quit griping. You can see it from here anyway. Just tough it out.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Mercenary B"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_053",
        "name2": "avg_npc_054",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "There's none of the gravitas here that you get watching on-site.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Mercenary A"
    },
    {
        "text": "Man, who the hell knew we'd actually take Victoria's capital? Dream of that in the past and you'd kick yourself.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Mercenary A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_053",
        "name2": "avg_npc_054",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "True enough.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Mercenary B"
    },
    {
        "text": "Still, next comes the hardest period. The dukes are all eyes on us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Mercenary B"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_053",
        "name2": "avg_npc_054",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmph. If they were good for anything, we wouldn't have seized Londinium so handily.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Mercenary A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_053",
        "name2": "avg_npc_054"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_402_1#5$1",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Feist"
    },
    {
        "text": "That was close...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Feist"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_402_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Phew. Lucky these mercs have no idea the plate has a gap you can get into here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Feist"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Feist makes his way to a pipeline entrance."
    },
    {
        "text": "He's done his survey. Somewhere along this passage is a connection to Sudean."
    },
    {
        "text": "But now on the verge of setting foot inside it, he has doubts after all."
    },
    {
        "text": "He wasn't kidding Patto. He's thought over every difficulty he might potentially face."
    },
    {
        "text": "Critically, though, and what he never said, was that he didn't have a plan for every problem."
    },
    {
        "text": "Granny wasn't wrong, after all. He's just a smith. He has a head that passes for smart, and relatively hardworking."
    },
    {
        "text": "These two things ensured he could muddle through life fine in Londinium's peaceful years, but there's no telling if they'll save his life right under the Sarkaz's noses."
    },
    {
        "text": "Tommy was right. If only those massive, hulking metal lads were still around."
    },
    {
        "text": "He's all grown up, and still he's never seen a Steam Knight before."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
