    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_metalpipe",
        "volume": 0.5,
        "loop": true,
        "channel": "pipe"
    },
    {
        "text": "Bang. Clang. Bang."
    },
    {
        "text": "With the factory ceiling so high, and the hatches so small, the view of the sky can't help being miniscule from within."
    },
    {
        "text": "Its ever-changing shades cast a like projection down into the factory. Never-changing is the sound of the assembly line, one hunk of metal striking another\u2014"
    },
    {
        "text": "As well as the sight of old Granny, standing at its side."
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopsound",
        "channel": "pipe",
        "fadetime": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_648_1#1$1",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Think it's dull, don't you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Catherine"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hold onto your hammer and spanner tight.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Catherine"
    },
    {
        "text": "If you really want to do something, you've got to persevere.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Catherine"
    },
    {
        "text": "You strike once, and you get nothing more than a hunk of beaten metal.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Catherine"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_648_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You strike again and again, and you can make steam armor.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Catherine"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_648_1#10$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You strike again and again, and then your child, and your children's children carry on striking\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Catherine"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_648_1#1$1",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "And we've got Londinium.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Catherine"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
