    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "text": "Atop every factory in Londinium stands a flag."
    },
    {
        "text": "That flag stands for Victoria."
    },
    {
        "text": "Not once since this factory's founding has that ever changed."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_649_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_648_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "But that, as of today, <i>has</i> changed.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lt. Colonel Lettou"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sign here, Ms. Catherine.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lt. Colonel Lettou"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_649_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_648_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "characteraction",
        "name": "right",
        "type": "move",
        "xpos": -100,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_penrustle",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2.5
    },
    {
        "text": "Without hesitation, Catherine, upon the document that embodies transferal of factory authority, signs a practiced signature."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_649_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "And now, the final changing of the flag.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lt. Colonel Lettou"
    },
    {
        "text": "Go.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lt. Colonel Lettou"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_053"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes, sir.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Warrior"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_649_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Stay, Ms. Catherine.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lt. Colonel Lettou"
    },
    {
        "text": "Be what it may, you are currently witnessing history.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lt. Colonel Lettou"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_648_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Catherine"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_648_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sir, can I light a smoke?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Catherine"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_649_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "By all means.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lt. Colonel Lettou"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_648_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.2
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_lighter",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_smokefemale",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_648_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sir, just as you've heard of me, I've heard about you too.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Catherine"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_649_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lt. Colonel Lettou"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_648_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Gaul.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Catherine"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_649_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes... My father was a Gaulish loyalist, that's no secret.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lt. Colonel Lettou"
    },
    {
        "text": "If you're querying me how I feel at this moment, Ms. Catherine...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lt. Colonel Lettou"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 3
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_649_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "An instant of joy that there was no blood shed throughout this procedure, but outside of that, my heart is filled with nothing but sorrow.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lt. Colonel Lettou"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_flag",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$distressed_intro",
        "key": "$distressed_loop",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "text": "Not far away, Sarkaz soldiers ferry over the flag that stands for them."
    },
    {
        "text": "Meanwhile, an additional two Sarkaz prepare to lower the current one."
    },
    {
        "text": "Catherine can see the happiness on their faces."
    },
    {
        "text": "And beyond them, a resplendent sunset glow."
    },
    {
        "text": "Catherine knows. It all signifies the dark isn't long away."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
