    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "text": "Feist turns his head, and from this position, he just so happens to be able to see the factory's flagpole towering high."
    },
    {
        "text": "He stands there, and watches as Victoria's flag descends, foot by foot."
    },
    {
        "text": "A moment later, foot by foot, the flag of the Sarkaz rises."
    },
    {
        "text": "As if nothing's changed at all."
    },
    {
        "text": "He takes a deep breath, and sets foot into the pipeline."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "It's pitch dark within. Apprehensively, he sets off, for the direction of Sudean he recalls."
    },
    {
        "text": "All of Londinium's munitions factories have now completed the handover, and on this day, they have exchanged Victorian flags for those of the Sarkaz."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "They flutter in the breeze."
    },
    {
